  "body": "G.J. Gardner Homes Ready Living featuring a Custom design.\r\n\r\nAll the hard work has been done - all consents are ready to go so you can start without any delays.\r\n\r\nThis thoughtfully designed two-level home offers a practical and modern layout with all the 4 bedrooms located upstairs for privacy and separation, and all living areas downstairs for easy entertaining and everyday living. \r\n\r\nModern fixtures and quality finishes throughout. Seamless indoor/outdoor flow to the outdoor entertaining area. \r\n\r\nWhether you're a family, professional couple or investor, this is an opportunity to secure a brand new home with certainty and confidence. \r\n\r\nGet in touch today for plans, specifications, and a full information pack.\r\n\r\nYour plan, our plans, or we can design from scratch. For more information visit our website http://www.gjgardner.co.nz\r\nMORE NEW ZEALANDERS TRUST G.J. GARDNER TO BUILD THEIR HOMES THAN ANY OTHER BUILDER.\r\n\r\nIf you’re thinking about building, make Home Prep the first step in your journey. It’s our essential step-by-step guide to the building process. Full of independent advice and handy information to help you have a great building experience. Get your free copy from gjgardner.co.nz today.\r\n\r\n*Price is an indication only and includes land. Some conditions may apply. Image is artist’s impression only.\r\n\r\nCopyright G.J. Gardner Homes",
